== Trivia ==
* Bozo is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=840361451 this Steam Workshop item] by electoon.
* This item is a reference to [[wikipedia:Bozo the Clown|Bozo the Clown]], a clown character whose broad popularity peaked in the 1960s.
* The item's ability to inflict [[fear]] may be a reference to [[wikipedia:Coulrophobia|coulrophobia]], the fear of clowns.
